<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-NACT Telecom on Focus List.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NACT Telecom on Focus List.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it added NACT Telecommunications Inc to the firm's Focus List of stocks.</p>
<p>-- Hambrecht was lead underwriter on NACT's three million share initial public offering, launched in February.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Wednesday at seven.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
